{"name":"Chic Modernist","title":"Chic Modernist","revision":231507,"url":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/Chic_Modernist","retrieved":"2026-09-06","license":"CC BY-SA","licenseUrl":"https://www.fandom.com/licensing","language":"en","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":"Visual"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Chic Modernist styles are very similar to high fashion and French themes, similar to French It Girl, but are not strictly reliant on either. It is open to interpretation, but remains stylish and elegant. This may also refer to room styles."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Fashion"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Chic Modernist fashion may also be referred to as \"smart casual\", meaning not super dressy but still looking nice and presentable. This can include pairing jeans with a blazer or heels, or a long skirt with a t-shirt. Often times clothing items remain solid colors rather than use patterns, otherwise, patterns are used very sparingly."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Feminine Fashion"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Feminine fashion may include:"},{"kind":"list","text":"Long coat"},{"kind":"list","text":"Turtlenecks"},{"kind":"list","text":"Fitted jeans"},{"kind":"list","text":"Blazers"},{"kind":"list","text":"Heels"},{"kind":"list","text":"Fitted slacks"},{"kind":"list","text":"Hats"},{"kind":"list","text":"Tailored skirts and dresses"},{"kind":"list","text":"Knee length/maxi skirts and dresses"},{"kind":"list","text":"Pearls"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Masculine Fashion"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Masculine fashion may include:"},{"kind":"list","text":"Button-down shirts"},{"kind":"list","text":"Nicely kept, T-shirts Less graphic t's, more solid colors"},{"kind":"list","text":"Knit sweaters"},{"kind":"list","text":"Fitted khakis/chinos"},{"kind":"list","text":"Jeans"},{"kind":"list","text":"Dress pants"},{"kind":"list","text":"Nice, polished shoes"},{"kind":"list","text":"Clean sneakers"},{"kind":"list","text":"Jean jackets"},{"kind":"list","text":"Leather jackets"},{"kind":"list","text":"Trench coats"},{"kind":"list","text":"Watches"},{"kind":"list","text":"Belts that match shoes"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Boards"},{"kind":"list","text":"Chic Modernist: Fall/Spring by Lady Hydra"},{"kind":"list","text":"Chic Modernist: Summer Edition by Lady Hydra"},{"kind":"list","text":"Chic Modernist: For Men by Lady Hydra"}],"contentStatus":"full-source","images":[{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/e/e0/Chic-modern-mini-skirt.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20201123031518","caption":"Chic-modern-mini-skirt","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:Chic-modern-mini-skirt.jpg","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0181-1.webp","localAvailable":true},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/c/c9/Couple-black-white-chic-outfit.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20201202034837","caption":"A black and white photo portraying examples of both male and female chic modernist looks.","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:Couple-black-white-chic-outfit.jpg","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0181-2.webp","localAvailable":true}]}